#27701
Road to Everwar.~
        Large pieces of handcrafted stone were used to construct the road
to the great city of Turra, since renamed Everwar after the mountain that
has been in the state of war for over a hundred years. The city rests
in the shadow of the mountain at the edge of the Turrian forest. Even
after years of war the dwarven crafted road is still as strong as the
day it was made.
~
