#27702
Inn of the last Gnome.~
        A row of small beds in varying conditions dominate the room with
a small dresser and stool next to each one. A few moth eaten old curtains
hang around each bed to give some privacy to anyone who sleeps here but
the half covered hole on the far wall doesn't stop much of the cold air from
blowing in. The inn used to be much larger but since the war has broken out
few travelers come to the city needing lodging, the knights knowing this
tore down the rest of the inn and used the materials for the outer wall.
~
