Before the gates.~
        The mighty walled city of Everwar has had to fend off attacks and sieges
by several of the armies in the war during the last hundred years. The worst
was the great ogre war nearly seventy five years ago when a few score of ogres
after destroying the Turrian fort in the forest thought the city would fall as
easily. A series of gates now keep any unwanted visitors from entering the
city.
