#27706
Between gates.~
        The knights have a few nasty tricks for anyone that thinks they have
gotten in the city after getting past the first gate. The knights will usually
let the first gate open easily but leave the second gate fourty feet away
locked. The invaders thinking the city is easily theirs once inside find
themselves trapped between two thirty foot tall walls and a gate that
the gods themselves could never open. Archers line the walls and fire into
the trapped army without mercy.
