statue armor~
This statue and armor is to the memory of SirMondun, Lord protector of
King Turra. His actual armor was never recovered, or at least what was
recovered wasn't in any shape to be displayed. SirMondun saved the life
of King Turra when he shoved the king aside during a fierce battle clearing
out a nest of green dragons from the forest. He was engulfed in a cloud of
acid and charged at the dragon ramming his lance down the dragons throat
just as the dragon was letting loose more acid.
~
