statue armor~
This armor belonged to Prince Tarra, First born of King Turra
and Queen Alena. Prince Tarra was a beloved son and leader of men
who sacrificed his own life in a battle against the cyclops who had
moved into the valley so that his men could live. The loss of Prince
Tarra was a major blow to the kingdom, especially King Turra who was
forced to stop riding after the last battle with a pack of ogres who
were trying to claim the mountain. Prince Tarra was replaced as next
in line as king by his brother Prince Takkrin.
